<title>USA: Imperial Petroleum sets stock payout.</title>
<headline>Imperial Petroleum sets stock payout.</headline>
<dateline>ALEXANDRIA, Va. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Petroleum Recovery Corp said Friday it has set a three percent common stock dividend to shareholders of record as of December 6.</p>
<p>The dividend, which will be in two-year restricted common shares, is to be paid out on December 31.</p>
